    "@value": "Basic"
   }
  ],
  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "This AIM implements the AIH-HSP Health Back End. It registers End Users and Third-Party Users from the User Profile they present and gives each the Tokens of the services that Profile allows: an End User all of them, on its own AIH Data only; a Third-Party User - a Third-Party User Profile, or an individual who is a member of an organisation - AIH Data Processing only, on any AIH Data whose licence allows the processing."
   }
  ],
