  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "Creates a digital copy of the digitised audio of an open reel magnetic tape for long-term preservation (Preservation Master Files) and an access copy, restored if necessary, for correct playback (Access Copy Files). The Audio Analysis for Preservation and the Video Analysis for Preservation exchange the Irregularity Files they produce, so the Module has a loop."
   }
