  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "3D Model Scene Description: see https://mpai.community/standards/mpai-osd/v1-5/ai-modules/3d-model-scene-description/. The 3D Model Scene Description (OSD‑3SD) AIM receives 3D Model Objects, the Descriptors of the Scene the Objects belong to, and their Space-Time information as inputs and produces the Descriptors of a Scene composed of 3D Model Objects and Scenes. The OSD‑3SD AIM may also produce an Alert conveying information on potential anomalies in the input 3D Model Objects:"
   }
