    "@value": "AIMs/PGM/V1.0/AudioEvents.cs"
   }
  ],
  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "The Audio Scene Description (PGM-ASD) AIM receives an Audio Object and produces the Audio Scene Descriptors describing it. In the PGM-AUA context, the AIM operates under the control of an Audio CXT Request issued by A-User Control (through the CXT-AUS Interface) and reports an Audio CXT Response on completion. The AIM references the Input and Output Data Types by name; their structure is specified by the respective Data Type definitions."
   }
  ],
