  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "Text to Speech: converts a Text Object (Basic Text Object or Text Object) into a Speech Object (Basic Speech Object or Speech Object). The input port accepts both OSD-BTO and OSD-TXO; the output port carries both OSD-BSO and OSD-SPO. The optional Personal Status port accepts a Speech Personal Status (MMC-SPS) or a Personal Status (MMC-EPS), e.g. an Emotion, whose Emotion the synthetic speech conveys."
   }
