  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "No Training Imperceptibility: the Module that evaluates the imperceptibility of a watermark inserted without training: a Module Trainer trains the Module (1) and the Unwatermarked Module infers; a second training (2) gives the parameters into which the NTI Watermark Embedder embeds the payload, and the Watermarked Module infers. The two inferences are the outputs."
   }
