  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "Direct Visual Identification: identifies the Visual Object that a person indicates by pointing. It receives a Basic Visual Object and describes its scene (Basic Multimodal Scene Description); Multimodal Scene Demultiplexing gives the Visual Objects of the scene; Entity Body Description gives the Body Descriptors of the person; Visual Direction Identification finds the Point of View that the pointing body indicates; Visual Object Extraction extracts the Visual Object that the Point of View crosses; and Visual Instance Identification gives the Instance Identifier of that object."
   }
  ],
