   {
    "@value": "Basic"
   }
  ],
  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "The Visual Instance Identification (PGM-VII) AIM is a Sub-AIM of Visual Scene Enhancement (PGM-VSE). It assigns semantic object-type labels to Visual Objects using classification models, domain knowledge, and Interaction History. Each Sub-AIM of Visual Scene Enhancement independently generates a Visual CXT Response, a Visual Domain Request and a Visual Interaction History Request. Visual Enhancement Multiplexing multiplexes them into the corresponding external output signals of Visual Scene Enhancement. [High-level specification derived from the Visual Scene Enhancement page. To be completed.]"
   }
  ],
