   }
  ],
  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "During-Training Watermark Insertion: inserts the payload in a neural network model while it trains it with a training dataset, and gives the watermarked model. Where a Locator is given, it tells the AIM where the watermark is to be placed and by which method; the AIM does not give it back. Where the watermark cannot be placed there, it gives no model and reports why."
   }
  ],
