  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "Visual Scene object Identification: for each visual object of the Basic Visual Scene, runs SCRFD and tags the object's Visual Qualifier with VisualObjectType (Face if a face is detected, else Object), emitting the re-qualified Basic Visual Objects of type Face on one output and those of type Object on the other. Face Recognition and Visual Instance Identification each act on their own type."
   }
  ],
