   }
  ],
  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "The Data Type exchanged between Basic Knowledge and Personality Alignment (Deliberation Exchange) through the Model Context Protocol. It has two modes, told apart by Mode: Request (RQ), sent by Basic Knowledge, that asks for the personality-aligned stance, and Response (RS), sent by Personality Alignment, that supplies the selected stance. The exchanges of one dialogue are told apart by TurnIndex within the DialogID."
   }
  ],
