  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "The Context Description (PGM-CXT) AIM is the A-User's perceptual front end to the spatial environment, integrating in a single Composite AIM the active capture of a multimodal scene and its interpretative enrichment. It receives raw Audio and Visual Objects, captures and structures the scene without LLM involvement and without MCP interactions, and then applies modality-specific analysis (audio and visual), cross-modal alignment, and optional domain knowledge to produce Enhanced Audio Scene Descriptors and Enhanced Visual Scene Descriptors together with an interpreted description of the User S"
   }
  ],
