    "@value": "Basic Speech Scene Description: see https://mpai.community/standards/mpai-osd/v1-5/ai-modules/basic-speech-scene-description/. The Basic Speech Scene Description (OSD-BSD) receives Speech Objects with their Space-Time information and produces the Descriptors of a Scene composed of Speech Objects and optionally an Alert:"
