    "@value": "Steered Response Function (CAE-SRF) of CAE-6DF V1.0: Obtains the Steered Response Function for a Microphone Array on a spherical grid of size H described by the parameter h using each time-frequency bin for each STFT. Multiple SRF AIMs are used for processing multiple Microphone Arrays"
   }
