  ],
  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "The Visual Enhancement Multiplexing (PGM-VEM) AIM is a Sub-AIM of Visual Scene Enhancement (PGM-VSE). It collects the outputs of all Sub-AIMs and assembles the Enhanced Visual Scene Descriptors and the multiplexed Visual CXT Response, Visual Domain Request, and Visual Interaction History Request. Each Sub-AIM of Visual Scene Enhancement independently generates a Visual CXT Response, a Visual Domain Request and a Visual Interaction History Request. Visual Enhancement Multiplexing multiplexes them into the corresponding external output signals of Visual Scene Enhancement. [High-level specificati"
   }
  ],
