   }
  ],
  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "The Data Type exchanged between any AIM of the A-User and Domain Access. It has two modes, told apart by Mode: Request (RQ), that supplies the evidence and the candidate interpretations to be checked together with the operations requested, and Response (RS), that returns the outcome, the validated interpretations with updated confidences and an explanation. SourceAIM states which AIM or Sub-AIM sends the Request or receives the Response, and Subject which medium or User it relates to. A Response carries the QueryID of its Request."
   }
  ],
