   }
  ],
  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "The Audio Scene Enhancement (PGM-ASE) AIM interacts with three external entities through two distinct patterns. A-User Control issues the Audio CXT Request and receives the Audio CXT Response reporting the goal understood and the outcome reached. Domain Access and Private Storage are queried: the Audio Domain Request and the Audio Interaction History Request are issued by the AIM, and the Audio Domain Response and the Audio Interaction History Response are received in reply, in general during a subsequent processing cycle Audio Scene Enhancement"
   }
  ],
