   {
    "@value": "Multimodal Scene Description: receives Speech, Audio, LiDAR and Visual Objects with their Space-Time, and optionally the Multimodal Scene Descriptors of a Scene to augment. It produces the Descriptors of a Multimodal Scene by processing each modality through its Scene Description SubAIM and combining the results with Multimodal Scene Multiplexing."
   }
