  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "Restores a Damaged Segment of an audio recording of speech: a neural network model of the speaker's voice is created (Speech Model Creation), the text of the damaged segment is synthesised with it (Text To Speech, of MPAI-MMC) and the Speech Restoration Assembly replaces the damaged segment with the synthesised speech."
   }
  ],
