   }
  ],
  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "Propositions produced by Prompt Creation. A Proposition links a subject to an object through a predicate, with spatial and temporal context where applicable. Intent and Referent Analysis uses Propositions to express the resolution of the referring expressions (pronouns, definite descriptions, demonstratives, deictic gestures); Prompt Contextualisation adds Propositions that represent contextual facts, timing guidance and phrasing constraints."
   }
  ],
