   }
  ],
  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "DRAFT, not published. What a participant asks the Secretary of a meeting (a request, UserCommandRQ) and what the Secretary answers (a response, UserCommandRS) under the same UserCommandID. Exactly one of the two is present, as in the User Command (CAE-UCM). The Secretary is a User (a Process) that speaks with the User of a participant; its Voice Command Interface turns what the participant says into the request."
   }
  ],
