 {
  "@id": "https://mpai.community/kg/aim/AIH-HFE-V1.1",
  "@type": [
   "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#AIM"
  ],
  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#acronym": [
   {
    "@value": "AIH-HFE-V1.1"
   }
  ],
  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#apiProfile": [
   {
    "@value": "Basic"
   }
  ],
  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "This AIM implements the AIH-HSP Health Front End. What it does depends on the User Profile it ingests. For an End User - an individual - it makes the End User's AIH Data, keeps it in the Secure Data Vault, trains on it, and has the Health Back End keep, process, de-identify, anonymise and audit it: that AIH Data only, and it needs no control of licence. For a Third-Party User - a Third-Party User Profile, or a User Profile of an individual who is a member of an organisation - it makes and keeps no AIH Data and trains nothing: it asks the Health Back End to process AIH Data, as the licence of each AIH Data prescribes, and does nothing else."
   }
  ],
